gn in</a><a class=\"btn btn-cyan\" href=\"/login?mode=register\">Get started</a></div></div></div><main style=\"position:relative;z-index:1\"><section class=\"hero\"><div class=\"wrap hero-grid\"><div><div class=\"hero-kicker\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>New: Shareable Money Personality cards</div><h1>The first finance app<br/>people want to<!-- --> <span class=\"grad\">show off</span>.</h1><p class=\"hero-sub\">Upload a bank statement and uncover the spending identity hiding inside your transactions. Not a boring budget. A sharp, cinematic, almost-uncomfortably-accurate personality reveal.</p><div class=\"hero-actions\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"/login?mode=register\">Discover your personality</a><a href=\"#personalities\" class=\"btn\">See examples</a></div><div class=\"hero-proof\"><div class=\"pill\">No bank login required</div><div class=\"pill\">CSV / OFX / QFX upload</div><div class=\"pill\">Private by design</div><div class=\"pill\">Results in seconds</div></div></div><div style=\"position:relative\"><div style=\"position:absolute;inset:-40px;border-radius:999px;background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(251,146,60,.12), transparent 65%);filter:blur(30px);pointer-events:none\"></div><div class=\"p-hero-card\"><img src=\"/personalities/where_did_it_go.webp\" alt=\"Where did it all go?\" style=\"width:100%;display:block;border-radius:28px\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"why-grid\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">Why this hits</div><h2>It starts with identity, not accounting.</h2></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px\"><div class=\"why-col\">Most finance tools demand discipline before they give you anything interesting. BudgetLens flips that — the reward comes first. A result you want to react to, argue with, and send to someone else.</div><div class=\"why-col\">33 archetypes detected automatically from your real spending data. No quiz. No self-reporting. No guessing. Just your statement and the truth.</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"how\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">How it works</div><h2>Fast, clean, and dangerously satisfying.</h2><p class=\"lead\">A simple loop: upload → analyze → reveal. Three steps to a result you&#x27;ll actually want to share.</p><div class=\"steps-grid\"><div class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"step-num\">01</div><div class=\"step-title\">Upload</div><p class=\"step-text\">Drop in a CSV, OFX, or QFX statement. No bank linking. No OAuth friction. No anxiety.</p></div><div class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"step-num\">02</div><div class=\"step-title\">Analyze</div><p class=\"step-text\">We map spending habits, merchant patterns, recurring charges, spikes, and behavioral signals.</p></div><div class=\"step-card\"><div class=\"step-num\">03</div><div class=\"step-title\">Reveal</div><p class=\"step-text\">You get a Money Personality that feels weirdly accurate — and a full financial breakdown to back it up.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"personalities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:28px\"><div><div class=\"eyebrow\">The hook</div><h2 style=\"margin:0\">Personalities people will want to screenshot.</h2></div><a class=\"btn btn-cyan\" style=\"white-space:nowrap\" href=\"/login?mode=register\">Find yours →</a></div><div class=\"p-grid\"><div class=\"p-card\"><img src=\"/personalities/glowing-broke.webp\" alt=\"Glowing Broke\" class=\"p-card-img\"/><div class=\"p-card-body\"><div class=\"p-card-num\">0<!-- -->1</div><div class=\"p-card-name\">Glowing Broke</div><div class=\"p-card-line\">You&#x27;re moisturized, exfoliated, and financially exposed.</div><p class=\"p-card-detail\">Luxury self-care meets zero restraint. You invest heavily in feeling good — regardless of the aftermath.</p><div class=\"p-card-cta\">Discover yours →</div></div></div><div class=\"p-card\"><img src=\"/personalities/full-send.webp\" alt=\"The Full Send\" class=\"p-card-img\"/><div class=\"p-card-body\"><div class=\"p-card-num\">0<!-- -->2</div><div class=\"p-card-name\">The Full Send</div><div class=\"p-card-line\">Your spending has main-character energy.</div><p class=\"p-card-detail\">Big swipes, fast decisions, unforgettable months. You live large and you know it.</p><div class=\"p-card-cta\">Discover yours →</div></div></div><div class=\"p-card\"><img src=\"/personalities/subscription-collector.webp\" alt=\"The Subscription Collector\" class=\"p-card-img\"/><div class=\"p-card-body\"><div class=\"p-card-num\">0<!-- -->3</div><div class=\"p-card-name\">The Subscription Collector</div><div class=\"p-card-line\">Tiny charges. Silent chaos.</div><p class=\"p-card-detail\">Your money leaks in elegant little monthly drips — Netflix, Spotify, and twelve others you forgot existed.</p><div class=\"p-card-cta\">Discover yours →</div></div></div><div class=\"p-card\"><img src=\"/personalities/wire-dancer.webp\" alt=\"The Wire Dancer\" class=\"p-card-img\"/><div class=\"p-card-body\"><div class=\"p-card-num\">0<!-- -->4</div><div class=\"p-card-name\">The Wire Dancer</div><div class=\"p-card-line\">You cleared the month by the skin of your teeth.</div><p class=\"p-card-detail\">Tight margin, clean finish. You balance on the edge every month and somehow always land it.</p><div class=\"p-card-cta\">Discover yours →</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"proof-grid\"><div class=\"proof-left\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Believability</div><h2>The result should feel earned, not random.</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:12px\">Every personality is backed by real numbers from your statement. You immediately see exactly why you got it.</p></div><div class=\"proof-right\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Example breakdown</div><div class=\"proof-lines\"><div class=\"proof-line\">62% of spend went to lifestyle and personal care.</div><div class=\"proof-line\">14 unique beauty and wellness merchants in one month.</div><div class=\"proof-line\">9 recurring self-care charges running quietly in the background.</div><div class=\"proof-line\">Spending peaks between 7 PM – 11 PM on weekdays.</div></div><div class=\"proof-verdict\">Which is exactly why you got <span>Glowing Broke.</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"privacy\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"trust-box\"><div style=\"max-width:62ch\"><div class=\"eyebrow\">Privacy</div><h2 style=\"margin:8px 0 10px\">No bank connections. No creepy feeling.</h2><p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;margin:0\">We never ask for your bank password. You upload a statement file, we analyze it locally, and you stay in full control. Your financial data is never sold or shared.</p></div><div class=\"trust-chips\"><div class=\"trust-chip\"><span class=\"tdot\" style=\"background:var(--cyan2);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(34,211,238,.12)\"></span>No bank login required</div><div class=\"trust-chip\"><span class=\"tdot\" style=\"background:var(--good);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(46,229,157,.10)\"></span>You own your categories</div><div class=\"trust-chip\"><span class=\"tdot\" style=\"background:var(--warn);box-shadow:0 0 0 5px rgba(255,204,102,.10)\"></span>Delete your data anytime</div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"section\" id=\"pricing\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px\"><div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"display:inline-block\">Pricing</div></div><h2 style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:6px\">Free during beta.</h2><p style=\"text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:28px\">All features unlocked. No credit card. Pro tier coming soon — early users lock in a lower rate.</p><div class=\"pricing-grid\"><div class=\"pricing-card\"><div class=\"pricing-tier\"